WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.342
Images live in the media library, so you can use them again anywhere on the site. Here we add one.

2
00:00:08.342 --> 00:00:19.333
Open the Add image form and choose a file from your computer.

3
00:00:19.333 --> 00:00:29.059
Drag the cross onto the most important part of the picture. Varbase keeps that part in view when it crops the image.

4
00:00:29.059 --> 00:00:37.399
Write alternative text that says what the image shows. People who use screen readers depend on it.
